  "unparsed_blocks": [
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Graves disease, relapsed after a completed course of carbimazole. Treated with oral radioiodine, 12 mCi.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05798319327731093,
        "y0": 0.21377672209026127,
        "x1": 0.7403361344537815,
        "y1": 0.22862232779097388
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Thyrotoxic since 2021, controlled on carbimazole for eighteen months and relapsed within three months of stopping it. Definitive treatment was discussed at length and radioiodine chosen over surgery.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05714285714285714,
        "y0": 0.251187648456057,
        "x1": 0.9411764705882353,
        "y1": 0.2814726840855107
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Pulse 104 regular, fine tremor, small diffuse goitre with no bruit. No eye signs. Weight 51.8 kg.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05798319327731093,
        "y0": 0.3028503562945368,
        "x1": 0.6756302521008404,
        "y1": 0.3182897862232779
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Admitted for the day. Pregnancy test negative before dosing. Oral radioiodine given at 10:15 hrs. Observed for four hours with no immediate reaction and discharged the same evening with radiation protection instructions.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05714285714285714,
        "y0": 0.34085510688836107,
        "x1": 0.9411764705882353,
        "y1": 0.37054631828978624
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "BEFORE DOSING (08/02/2024)",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05966386554621849,
        "y0": 0.39548693586698336,
        "x1": 0.2647058823529412,
        "y1": 0.40973871733966744
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Radioiodine (I-131) 12 mCi orally. Propranolol 20 mg three times daily to continue for six weeks. Carbimazole stopped four days before dosing as planned.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05714285714285714,
        "y0": 0.6413301662707839,
        "x1": 0.9428571428571428,
        "y1": 0.669833729216152
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Avoid close contact with children and pregnant women for seven days. Avoid pregnancy for six months. Thyroid function to be checked at six weeks and then every six weeks - hypothyroidism is expected and is not a complication. Report any neck swelling, fever or sore throat at once.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05714285714285714,
        "y0": 0.6929928741092637,
        "x1": 0.9436974789915966,
        "y1": 0.7369358669833729
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Tested by: Y. Gaikwad (DMLT) Results released electronically. Verified before release.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 0.05798319327731093,
        "y0": 0.751187648456057,
        "x1": 0.36554621848739494,
        "y1": 0.7785035629453682
      },
      "block_label": "text"
    },
